":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids August to September, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids went from 22% of normal in January to February to 283% in March to April. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 16623 lowest at 43% of normal in 2011.</p>"}
